{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1491395-ground-zero-of-explosive","id":1491395,"title":"Ground zero of explosive","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-25T23:30:00-07:00","id":1491395,"title":"Ground zero of explosive","content":"Trying to understand the book Hurt Locker.p.134 and 135 concerning explosive.<br /> <br /> Determining the primary blast area of a light frag is quite simple. Determining the sexondary blast area is quite easy also. However, determining the ground zero confuse me. The choice of wording makes little sens to me at page 135 When they speak about this trait listing 3 values, i'm lost, and apparently, im not alone.<br /> <br /> Can you help me determine ground zero, primary blast, and secondary blast area ?. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2986-warriorshaman","name":"Warriorshaman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-26T05:09:37-07:00","id":1491415,"title":"","content":"They don't have three values, they have three <i>areas</i>. There's no value listed for determining ground zero because &quot;ground zero&quot; means &quot;the point where the explosion starts.&quot; If a grenade explodes right next to/on top of someone, they're at ground zero.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-26T17:04:00-07:00","id":1491444,"title":"","content":"Ok, its confusing.<br /> <br /> It does not gives much so I will copy/paste a short part.<br /> <br /> On page 135 it is written under the Blast area section:<br /> <br /> &quot;This trait is listed in three values separated by slashes.<br /> The first number is the ground zero blast area, the second<br /> number is the primary blast area, and the secondary blast<br /> area is twice this range.&quot;<br /> <br /> It was the part that was confusing me.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2986-warriorshaman","name":"Warriorshaman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-26T17:20:16-07:00","id":1491446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Warriorshaman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1491395-ground-zero-of-explosive?p=1491444#post1491444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, its confusing.<br /> <br /> It does not gives much so I will copy/paste a short part.<br /> <br /> On page 135 it is written under the Blast area section:<br /> <br /> &quot;This trait is listed in three values separated by slashes.<br /> The first number is the ground zero blast area, the second<br /> number is the primary blast area, and the secondary blast<br /> area is twice this range.&quot;<br /> <br /> It was the part that was confusing me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then I'm extra confused, because that isn't how it shows up in the version I get redownloading from the file from the book's DTRPG page, nor the Final Download version I get from My Library. Both of them say this on Page 135:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Blast Area:</b> This is the diameter (in meters or yards) of the explosion. Explosives have three blast areas: ground zero, primary, and secondary. The number listed is for the primary blast area, while the secondary blast area is twice this range. </div> </div> </div>The phrase &quot;separated by&quot; only shows up in either version when talking about ballistic and general Armor ratings on page 140. The phrase &quot;three values&quot; shows up in neither.<br /> <br /> You may have an old copy of the book. <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/199275/Chronicles-of-Darkness-Hurt-Locker\" target=\"_blank\">Redownload the PDF</a> and check if anything's different.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-26T20:45:08-07:00","id":1491451,"title":"","content":"You are probably right. I was on my phone earlier, and one of my friend found out that in the forum there was a section speaking about the errata of that book. The ending part of the paragraph was what I copy/pasted and was to be removed. I do not know if it was or not, but I will look to get a more recent copy of the book. Thank you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2986-warriorshaman","name":"Warriorshaman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}